  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Modelo Sem Tratar o Desequilíbrio\n",
    "# Random Forest"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 9,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "0.6151560178306092\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "best_model = None\n",
    "best_f1 = 0\n",
    "\n",
    "for depth in range(2, 16):\n",
    "\n",
    "    model = RandomForestClassifier(\n",
    "        random_state=12345,\n",
    "        max_depth=depth,\n",
    "        n_estimators=100\n",
    "    )\n",
    "\n",
    "    model.fit(features_train, target_train)\n",
    "\n",
    "    predictions = model.predict(features_valid)\n",
    "\n",
    "    score = f1_score(target_valid, predictions)\n",
    "\n",
    "    if score > best_f1:\n",
    "        best_f1 = score\n",
    "        best_model = model\n",
    "\n",
    "print(best_f1)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# ROC-AUC "
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 10,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "0.8661244334417184\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "probabilities = best_model.predict_proba(features_valid)\n",
    "\n",
    "auc = roc_auc_score(\n",
    "    target_valid,\n",
    "    probabilities[:,1]\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(auc)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "O modelo apresentou desempenho razoável, porém ainda limitado pela presença de classes desbalanceadas."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Correção do Desequilíbrio\n",
    "\n",
    "Serão utilizadas duas abordagens:\n",
    "\n",
    "# Método 1 — Class Weight"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 12,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "0.6490384615384616\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "best_f1_weight = 0\n",
    "\n",
    "for depth in range(2,16):\n",
    "\n",
    "    model = RandomForestClassifier(\n",
    "        random_state=12345,\n",
    "        max_depth=depth,\n",
    "        n_estimators=100,\n",
    "        class_weight='balanced'\n",
    "    )\n",
    "\n",
    "    model.fit(features_train, target_train)\n",
    "\n",
    "    predictions = model.predict(features_valid)\n",
    "\n",
    "    score = f1_score(target_valid,predictions)\n",
    "\n",
    "    if score > best_f1_weight:\n",
    "        best_f1_weight = score\n",
    "        best_model_weight = model\n",
    "\n",
    "print(best_f1_weight)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "A utilização de pesos balanceados permitiu ao modelo dar maior importância à classe minoritária, melhorando o F1-score."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Método 2 — Oversampling"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 13,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "train_data = pd.concat(\n",
    "    [features_train, target_train],\n",
    "    axis=1\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "majority = train_data[train_data['Exited']==0]\n",
    "minority = train_data[train_data['Exited']==1]\n",
    "\n",
    "minority_upsampled = resample(\n",
    "    minority,\n",
    "    replace=True,\n",
    "    n_samples=len(majority),\n",
    "    random_state=12345\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "upsampled = pd.concat(\n",
    "    [majority, minority_upsampled]\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "features_up = upsampled.drop('Exited', axis=1)\n",
    "target_up = upsampled['Exited']"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Treinamento:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 14,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "0.6519337016574587\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "best_f1_up = 0\n",
    "\n",
    "for depth in range(2,16):\n",
    "\n",
    "    model = RandomForestClassifier(\n",
    "        random_state=12345,\n",
    "        max_depth=depth,\n",
    "        n_estimators=100\n",
    "    )\n",
    "\n",
    "    model.fit(features_up, target_up)\n",
    "\n",
    "    predictions = model.predict(features_valid)\n",
    "\n",
    "    score = f1_score(target_valid, predictions)\n",
    "\n",
    "    if score > best_f1_up:\n",
    "        best_f1_up = score\n",
    "        best_model_up = model\n",
    "\n",
    "print(best_f1_up)"
   ]
  },
